WEBVTT

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.670
People often ponder,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.300
what is the hardest thing about love?

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.790
Oh! Virgos are going to have
super bad luck this month!

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.440
Everything is going to go wrong.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:39.980
Sha Jia, you have to be more careful.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:44.000
I heard that buying crystals
can help to ward off evil.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.280
After class, I'll go shopping with you.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.230
Wow!

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.050
Capricorns will meet
their soulmate this month!

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.790
Who among us is a Capricorn?

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:52.260
Hey, Liu Siwen!

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.780
Isn't your birthday on January 2nd?

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.000
Are you a Capricorn?

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.140
Some people say

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.990
the hardest thing is to encounter
someone that is destined by fate.

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:23.560
Others say

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.200
the hardest thing is gathering
the courage to confess your love.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.000
Sis!

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:33.910
Hmm?

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.170
Will you be my girlfriend?

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:42.740
But right now,

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:44.760
the obstacle before me...

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.550
...is an unexpected problem.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.090
"Wheelbarrow" move!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.290
The network latency is too high,

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:29.240
this broken phone's CPU is too slow,

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:31.340
this new version has such poor balance!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.830
You have slow motor reflexes,

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.990
stop making excuses.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.790
Hurry up and switch.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.500
Give it your best shot.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.540
We promised to help her if we lose.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.650
That's child's play.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.460
Are you kidding me?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.290
At least I caught her once!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.720
You lost without even
laying a finger on her!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.010
Two weak chickens
fighting amongst themselves.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:06.480
I don't hit girls.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.640
It's over.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.450
Looking at the way you two handle things,

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.190
it seems we'll fail our task this time.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:15.700
What are the details?

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:16.480
Tell me about it.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.000
It seems pretty exciting.

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:21.630
The person who asked us for help

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:23.450
had fallen in love with the daughter
of a martial arts family

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.880
and has confessed his love
to her multiple times.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.460
However, her father is
an unrivalled master.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.790
He would only accept those who could
defeat him as his son-in-law.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.600
Besides,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.810
they have never accepted
an outsider into the family before.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:55.140
This person has tried over and over,

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.090
failing every single time.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.360
The reason for that

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.390
is the unrivalled master

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:04.380
has a unique set of skills.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.370
He has never been able to
figure out the secret behind it.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.520
Hence, he needs us to
help him figure out the trick

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.880
in order to marry the one he loves.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.590
Lu Guang,

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.880
isn't this what you
figured out at a glance?

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:21.920
It's impossible.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:26.010
This photo of them was taken
before one of the fights.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.790
It seems like they're equally
in love with each other.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.400
He's forcefully tearing them apart.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:38.800
By the way, he doesn't have
many chances left.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:50.100
Can't you just figure out
the old master's tricks

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.950
by foreseeing the events that happened
12 hours after the picture was taken?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.570
That's such an intuitive detail.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.640
I still need you to
visit the scene in person

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.000
and become my eyes.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.410
All right.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.760
We lost the bet after all.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:08.760
Get ready.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:18.360
Let's go.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.460
Before the song of victory plays,

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:26.870
let's take an engagement photo.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.720
Stop joking around.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.040
With my dad's stubborn temper,

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.620
he'd never go easy on you.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.460
I practiced very hard this year,

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.890
learning many secret skills.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.630
You just wait and see.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:40.010
You've boasted every single time,

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:41.730
yet always returned without succeeding.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:47.050
Do you still remember
the first time you paid a visit?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:20.610
No outsider has ever set foot
in our family for generations.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.800
And he's just barely come of age.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:21.800
Endure it.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.000
He's so much younger than you.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.290
Don't waste your efforts.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.800
It would be so embarrassing
once this spreads out!

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.460
I... I...

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.250
I've come to marry you!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:33.310
Ou Yang!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.300
Oh my goodness, stop laughing.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.770
Are you not ashamed?

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:50.840
Somebody, help!

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.390
Hurry up and carry him into the house.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:56.980
Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:57.990
Control yourself.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:00.230
I'll try, I'll try.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.030
This experience is too funny.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.030
Don't shout this time.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:05.560
But I want to.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.630
--But I want to.
--Don't you dare!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.990
I wasn't the one who said this first.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.930
I still have the evidence.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.450
Why are you still
keeping this antique thing?

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.460
Hurry up and delete it!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.440
You look so cute when you're blushing.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.020
Idiot!

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.400
Don't add your own lines.

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:24.900
Siwen.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.010
There's something

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.010
that I think I have to tell you.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:30.280
Senior

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:33.280
asked my father for my hand in marriage.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.130
Has your father agreed?

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:42.840
Even if he has,

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.030
I will not agree to it.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.980
All right. If I stay any longer,
my parents will start to worry.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.590
I'll see you at the top
of the mountain later.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:49.620
Good luck!

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.990
No wonder Qiao Ling said...

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.340
He doesn't have many chances left.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.090
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.660
you should know that

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.030
the same photo cannot be reused.

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:09.910
Therefore,

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.750
this is our only chance.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.320
I have to go up the mountain on foot?

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.000
Where did Qiao Ling find
such an awful task?

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.930
You're too slow.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.550
You have to reach the top of
the mountain within two hours.

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.930
Why are you kicking a man when he's down?

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.860
Why am I always the one who suffers?

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.610
Lu Guang.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.000
Lu Guang!

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.010
Where the hell did you go?

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.460
Where are you right now?

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.880
I'm almost at the top.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:08.800
What now?

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:09.550
Stop.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:11.740
You're too early.

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:12.980
Stop moving.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.800
What is this devious trick
that he's learnt this time?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.260
It's time.

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:21.710
Shout.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:22.450
Shout like your life depends on it.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:24.810
Ou Yang!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.030
I've come to marry you!

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.000
All right, that's enough.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:31.210
It's the same every year.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.960
Can you be more creative?

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.330
This time,

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.990
I must defeat you.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:44.680
First, you're not from
a martial arts family.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.040
Our families aren't a good match.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.230
Second, you're younger than her.
Such an inappropriate thing,

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.360
I will never accept it
for as long as I live.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:51.500
Put your left palm forward.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.590
Lean forward.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.300
Shield your heart with your right fist.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.290
It's reversed!
Your left and right are reversed!

00:10:57.990 --> 00:10:59.640
You can't even get the basic stance right.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:00.710
How outrageous!

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:02.200
Deflect his blow upward
with your left hand.

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:06.130
Aren't you usually quite wily
when you're playing basketball?

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.680
Why are you so slow to react now?

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.520
Stop sitting on the ground.
Get up quickly.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.130
Be careful. Don't get up so high.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:14.640
Duck!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.250
Withdraw your right foot.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.320
Swing your right fist
to limit his movement.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.580
Lower your center of gravity.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.990
Shut up!

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:25.120
This buzzing is giving me a headache.

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.020
You have to listen carefully
in order to keep up.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:29.880
Just predict the direction of the attack.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.960
Let me

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:31.750
handle the rest.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.200
Look at you, so frivolous.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.300
You look nothing like
a decent martial arts student.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:37.450
Father-in-law,

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.330
I will defeat your form with formlessness.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:40.190
You can go first.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.960
You little brat!

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:43.380
How disrespectful!

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:44.000
Right.

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:44.740
Another right.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:45.380
Below.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:46.290
Left.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.880
What technique is this?

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.530
How could he see through
your father like that?

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.440
Don't go overboard.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:01.780
You still need to get hit occasionally.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:03.540
Bah!

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.550
Using hidden weapons?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.760
Create a diversion!

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.750
"Monkey steals peach" move!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.640
What

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.690
just happened?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.910
Is this the killer move

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:25.060
that the client has never
been able to figure out?

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:33.840
Again.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:35.420
We can surely see it clearly.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.700
I've been trying to learn
this move from Master

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:41.830
for the past ten years.

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:43.760
I have had a crush on Ou Yang
for a very long time.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.560
Master, please approve of our marriage.

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.460
You have finally come to ask
my permission after so long,

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.880
that means you already have
a well-thought-out plan.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.890
Well then, let's have a fight.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.010
I can't do it anymore.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.000
I can't see his trick clearly at all.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.630
My whole body hurts so badly.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.030
My consciousness

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.880
is drifting away.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.010
I can't feel my hands anymore.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.030
Is this where it ends?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.430
It's not over yet.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.030
What?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.000
His body is already seriously injured.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.300
How is he still fighting?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.440
But what I'm seeing

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.050
is what happened back then.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:44.510
I'm truly at my limit already.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:48.400
What is giving him enough support
for him to stand up again?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.420
Stop fighting!

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:14.960
Father, stop fighting!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.630
I won't marry anyone
for the rest of my life, all right?

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:50.950
How is it?

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.650
Have you learned his trick?

00:14:58.070 --> 00:14:58.990
What is it?

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.000
Did you forget it because
it's too complicated?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.840
We couldn't see it clearly

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:04.010
even until the end.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.760
It happened too quickly.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.040
Is that so?

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.010
That's all right.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.980
We just wanted to help others anyway.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.640
There's nothing we can do
if it's truly impossible.

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.010
Qiao Ling,

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.020
where did you find this task?

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:22.210
I've told you,

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.200
--it doesn't matter--
--Last month, I walked past a dojo.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.190
There had been rumors lately

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.020
about a series of murders happening.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.920
So I was thinking of
learning some self-defense,

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.550
then I got to know him.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.290
Young lady.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.800
What do you want to learn?

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:44.480
The Master of this dojo.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.360
You can come in and
have a seat if you're interested.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.550
Learning is one thing,
having a chat is another.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:01.030
In order to proudly marry
the one he loves,

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.980
he refused to give up...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.000
...year after year.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.210
The girl's father felt that their families
were not a good match,

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:15.000
as he did not learn martial arts.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.050
Hence, he practiced
martial arts painstakingly,

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.480
and even opened his own dojo.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:23.010
Everyone laughed at him and her family,
saying they were stubborn.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.990
What era are they living in

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:27.670
that they have to fight
over a status for a lifetime?

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:42.420
Go back in.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:45.000
I don't think he'll come anymore.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.840
The one who should never have come
will finally stop showing up.

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:54.010
However, the one who should be here...

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.000
Master!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:01.790
Please, stop!

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.450
I... I surrender!

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.800
I surrender!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:08.250
...quit a long time ago.

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:22.710
I thought you always said
to never ask about the future?

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:25.460
I'm here to keep an eye on you.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.700
Ou Yang!

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.160
I've come to marry you!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:42.000
Ever since I made up my mind,

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.380
I started living my days
with a disciplined diet,

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:46.170
going to bed early and waking up early,

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:49.130
But practicing extremely hard.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.790
But I never realized how strong
a martial artist truly was.

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:53.690
I couldn't defeat him,

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.490
neither could I outlive him.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:56.730
What's more,

00:17:56.730 --> 00:18:00.370
I had to climb so many
flights of stairs every time.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.630
Wait a minute.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:03.520
The both of you have been
together for so long,

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.810
why is it a must to receive
her father's approval?

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.440
I persevere,

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:11.800
because I promised Ou Yang
I would marry her.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.340
That's why I must fulfill that promise.

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:20.790
I have a plan.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.420
Would you like to try it?

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:32.590
Siwen!

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.600
Next year, can we...

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.310
...fight at the bottom of
the mountain instead?

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.570
I'm the one who lost.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:11.370
Why did you have to
wait until now to let go?

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:17.710
Even my grandchild is
going overseas for competitions.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.980
As the father,

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.800
he couldn't even defeat
the child's grandfather,

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.440
how was I supposed to approve of him?

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:27.470
--People often ponder,

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:29.800
Don't shout this time.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:29.800
People often ponder,

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:30.510
But I want to.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.980
what is the hardest thing about love?

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.980
I wasn't the one who said this first.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.570
I still have the evidence.

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:37.140
Why are you still keeping
this antique thing?

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.450
I would say...

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:38.250
Hurry up and delete it!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:32.990
I didn’t pick up the phone that rang for twelve seconds

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.450
I just want to close my eyes under the smoke

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:35.970
Let the neon lights around me retreat a bit

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:37.480
Only under the stars can I see your face clearly

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.160
To a wine glass that’s about to fall

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:40.820
Say silently, defy gravity, and float

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.130
I want to return to the past

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.770
But I’m held in place by this frenzy

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.510
The scent of this old photo film still lingers in my home

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:49.640
So many years have passed, can I still be myself

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:58.600
I glanced unconsciously at my right hand

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:01.690
That falling leaf brushed past my sleeve cuff

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:04.670
There wasn’t enough time to collect this weather

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:07.670
Why was my gaze stolen again

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.090
The dream world, separated from reality, turns into bubbles

00:22:18.110 --> 00:22:20.680
How should I, who is floating, protect myself

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:30.130
In this gap in time I stopped thinking

00:22:30.150 --> 00:22:32.800
I realized most my troubles were just me troubling myself
